{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vd7RepPTPD1794811527.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產屯門NOVO WALK 分行資深分區營業經理陳智生表示，分行新近促成屯門NOVO LAND 1A期Elverum 1座中層C室買賣成交，實用面積236平方呎，開放式間隔，叫價365萬元，減價20萬元，以345萬元成交，實用呎價14619元。<br/>陳智生表示，買家為投資客，見NOVO LAND屬大型屋苑，樓齡新，受到租客歡迎，遂入市作收租之用。按同類單位市值租金約1.2萬元計，上址租金回報料4.2厘。<br/>陳智生指，原業主於2022年以約366.2萬元買入單位，持貨約4年，賬面蝕讓21.2萬元，物業貶值約6%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.392392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T03:52:28.540614+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:45.498054+00:00","content_hash":"39df2e16fa90f4d429795bfb2f11d5676a59fba53d4fe1d3becf4757c653bd26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.392392+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}